  m_Text: "\nWe hope you're excited to try out this game. Before you get started though,
    our team wanted to let you know that upon getting your consent we're going to
    continue improving our game with your device data. Specifically, we will be using
    your device data to optimize the gameplay mechanics, application stability, and
    to show relevant ads. \nWe thank you for playing our game and helping us in anyway
    possible. If you're ever not interested in sharing your data, you can always re-adjust
    your settings at a later time as well. \n"
